<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#DatasetSeries_MobilityTheme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values classify the theme of a mobility dataset series using the Mobility Theme controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/mobility-theme), which is organised in two hierarchy levels: data content category and data content sub-category. At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if no applicable concept exists, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/mobility-theme/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#DatasetSeries_MobilityTheme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "mobilityTheme should include at least one concept from the Mobility Theme vocabulary; use 'other' if none applies."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#DatasetSeries_MobilityTheme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:cb24491d2bf34a6a40d0666f1314226324b96805642fd91480bb246dc47ba84457b .
