<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#DatasetSeries_MobilityTheme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#DatasetSeries> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#DatasetSeries_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#DatasetSeries_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "The geographical coverage of the dataset series, taken from the EU authority tables for Continent (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/continent), Countries and territories (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country) or Place (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/place), or from GeoNames. Use of these vocabularies is recommended; other values are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#DatasetSeries_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "spatial should include at least one value from the EU Continent, Country or Place tables, or from GeoNames."@en .
