<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#DatasetSeries_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#DatasetSeries> .
