<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_GeoreferencingMethod_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values state the georeferencing method of the resource, using the Georeferencing Method controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/georeferencing-method). At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if none applies, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/georeferencing-method/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_GeoreferencingMethod_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "georeferencingMethod should include at least one concept from the Georeferencing Method vocabulary; use 'other' if none applies."@en .
