<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_IntendedInformationService_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values describe the intended information service for the dataset, using the Intended information service controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/intended-information-service). At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if none applies, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/intended-information-service/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."@en .
