<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_MobilityTheme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_NetworkCoverage_CV> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_NetworkCoverage_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values state the transport network coverage of the dataset, using the Network Coverage controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/network-coverage). At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if none applies, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/network-coverage/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_NetworkCoverage_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "networkCoverage should include at least one concept from the Network Coverage vocabulary; use 'other' if none applies."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_NetworkCoverage_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:cb25e2b6fa323382afefad8b089309d9b770385ae0c230a7ff9b93b2aa1e6fc4300 .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_NetworkCoverage_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_NetworkCoverage_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Publisher_CV> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Publisher_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "The entity responsible for publishing the dataset, referenced from the EU Corporate body authority table (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body). Use of this vocabulary is recommended; other values, such as a national organisation not listed there, are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Publisher_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "publisher should include at least one concept from the EU Corporate body table."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Publisher_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:cb2d2d1d83cee4f34011b17ebfe05e8c60cd73e197eaf5eb8cfe851cc0f71f745fd .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Publisher_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Publisher_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> .
