<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "The geographical coverage of the dataset, taken from the EU authority tables for Continent (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/continent), Countries and territories (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country) or Place (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/place), or from GeoNames. Use of these vocabularies is recommended; other values are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "spatial should include at least one value from the EU Continent, Country or Place tables, or from GeoNames."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:cb38bff5d780d3fb5b896707b67a13c897dfd6f051faf9c80465ee959a923aa6d78 .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Spatial_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#Dataset> .
