<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Theme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values categorise the dataset using the EU Data theme authority table (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme). At least one value must come from this vocabulary. Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Theme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "dcat:theme should include at least one concept from the EU Data theme table."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Theme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#or> _:cb1c42565739a986290f209505d7d01ff20e52bed2fef9c5f336fda67579a48905d .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_Theme_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
