<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_TransportMode_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values state the transport modes covered by the dataset, using the Transport Mode controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/transport-mode). At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if none applies, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/transport-mode/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Dataset_TransportMode_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "transportMode should include at least one concept from the Transport Mode vocabulary; use 'other' if none applies."@en .
