<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Distribution_ApplicationLayerProtocol_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values state the application layer protocol of the distribution, using the Application layer protocol controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/application-layer-protocol). At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if none applies, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/application-layer-protocol/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."@en .
