<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Distribution_CommunicationMethod_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values state the communication method of the distribution, using the Communication Method controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/communication-method), which distinguishes push and pull. Use of this vocabulary is recommended; other values are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Distribution_CommunicationMethod_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "communicationMethod should include at least one concept from the Communication Method vocabulary."@en .
