<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Distribution_License_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "The licence under which the distribution is made available, referencing a concrete standard licence from the EU Licence authority table (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licence). Use of this vocabulary is recommended; other values are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Distribution_License_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "license should include at least one concept from the EU Licence table."@en .
