<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Distribution_MobilityDataStandard_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values identify the mobility data standard adopted by the distribution, using the Mobility data standard controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/mobility-data-standard). At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if no suitable standard is listed, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/mobility-data-standard/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated, for example a custom mobilitydcatap:MobilityDataStandard instance giving a version or a national profile."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#Distribution_MobilityDataStandard_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "mobilityDataStandard should include at least one concept from the Mobility data standard vocabulary; use 'other' if none applies."@en .
