<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#RightsStatement_Conditions_CV> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#RightsStatement_Conditions_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "Values state the conditions for access and usage of a Rights Statement, using the Conditions for access and usage controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/conditions-for-access-and-usage). At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if none applies, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/conditions-for-access-and-usage/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/releases/3.0.0/shacl/mdr-vocabularies#RightsStatement_Conditions_CV> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "conditions for access and usage (dct:type) should include at least one concept from the Conditions for access and usage vocabulary; use 'other' if none applies."@en .
