_:cb28d738387b42e1a855ac7705393991fc2190950835015d13a18bd71a87fdde3b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "The spatial reference system used in the dataset, identified by a coordinate reference system URI from the OGC EPSG register. This register is not a SKOS scheme, so membership is checked by URI pattern rather than skos:inScheme. The value space is closed: only EPSG URIs are allowed."@en .
_:cb28d738387b42e1a855ac7705393991fc2190950835015d13a18bd71a87fdde3b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "referenceSystem value must be an OGC EPSG coordinate reference system URI."@en .
